her-name>National Foundation for Infectious Diseases</publisher-name><fpage>116</fpage><lpage>128</lpage></citation></ref></ref-list><glossary><title>Abbreviations</title><def-list><def-item><term>CF</term><def><p>complement fixation</p></def></def-item><def-item><term>EIA</term><def><p>enzyme immunoassay</p></def></def-item><def-item><term>ID</term><def><p>immunodiffusion</p></def></def-item></def-list></glossary></back></article>